WEBVTT

01:05:57.496 --> 01:06:00.413
For sure. And in fact,
I think I'm hopeful,

01:06:00.538 --> 01:06:02.746
since these are the two things
I've thought the most about.

01:06:02.746 --> 01:06:04.663
I'm excited for the day when
someone combines them

01:06:05.038 --> 01:06:09.329
and uses A.I. to better select
who did more fairly,

01:06:09.329 --> 01:06:12.454
maybe even select who to fund
and how to advise them

01:06:12.454 --> 01:06:16.829
and really kind of make entrepreneurship
super widely available that will lead

01:06:16.829 --> 01:06:21.871
to like better outcomes and sort of more
societal wealth for all of us. So are.

01:06:22.913 --> 01:06:24.038
So, yeah, I think.

01:06:27.079 --> 01:06:32.121
Broadening the set of people able to start
companies and that sort of get